      "content": "To make your predictive risk assessment robust, prioritize real-time sentiment analysis from social media and localized news feeds alongside your existing demographic and crime data. Incorporating environmental factors like thermal sensors, air quality indices, and historical emergency response times will also significantly enhance the model's accuracy. Finally, ensure you include connectivity density and recent rumor propagation metrics to capture how quickly tensions might spread across different neighborhoods.",
